{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--eu-ai-act-specialist","name":"eu-ai-act-specialist","description":"EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) operational compliance for compliance teams. Three Article-level decisions: (1) What's the risk tier of this AI system — prohibited (Art. 5), high-risk (Art. 6 + Annex III), limited-risk (Art. 50), or minimal-risk? (2) For high-risk systems, what's the Article 43 conformity assessment route (Module A internal control vs Module H full QMS + notified body) and what goes in the Annex IV technical documentation? (3) Per organizational role (provider / deployer / importer / distributor / authorized representative), what are the active obligations and deadlines? Use during AI system intake review, when planning conformity assessment, or when scoping deployer obligations. Cites Articles + Annexes for every output. NOT executive AI strategy (see chief-ai-officer-advisor). NOT a legal substitute.","category":"Cloud & DevOps","tags":["eu","ai","act","specialist","regulation","2024","1689","operational","compliance","teams.","three","article","level","decisions","what","risk","tier","system"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"ra-qm-team/compliance-team-eu-ai-act/skills/eu-ai-act-specialist","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/ra-qm-team/compliance-team-eu-ai-act/skills/eu-ai-act-specialist","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":9,"bytes":93784,"sha256":"fe5d4ea4f5c03bc49302f06b7a09b9ff263fe4a3ae5d9434f3bfa081b6c414fd","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"ra-qm-team/compliance-team-eu-ai-act/skills/eu-ai-act-specialist/SKILL.md","bytes":15012,"sha256":"fe5d4ea4f5c03bc49302f06b7a09b9ff263fe4a3ae